  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f77a9045a4a81c24e91ad85423b782b2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 995834500}
  talkingPoints:
  - Hey! you want to talk about climate change? Well listen up kid, climate change
    is just a hoax cooked up by the government to control us. The planet's always
    had hot and cold cycles. It's just nature doing its thing!
  - You know what, you actually make a good point. But come on! If climate change
    was real, why do we still have record snowfalls? If the planet's getting hotter,
    shouldn't everything be melting?
  - That is also a good point. What else do you know?
